{"v":4,"catch":"威脅飆升！ 席捲大地的興奮！","desc":"《SILK WORM》是TECMO於1988年推出的射擊遊戲。\n1P操作直升機，2P操作輕型裝甲車，擊敗舞台盡頭等待的頭目即可通關。\n1P 和 2P 的操作方法不同，請選擇最適合您的飛行器。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-02-01","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8ce3278ae72c6ed5bb6552250917287b88b61f0f9ffc21c2408498dd51c3942d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/895d707770ca71118f4b649d7129681d68e7fec9483f07cde8ca75f12af39277.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a4399e5de8a2bc2d9a4cb8c3ba29208a41cf6fe13eb78727ca9b8cdecdee3ffe.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3442acbda54e3f08eb96b2710221ba6394e15c1555ead1c83f164ee6eb4038bd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f214dd5da0f9d5771f99e20a6e923909f5a882e0d86c3ab8d4209b9392065bb1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0e6adbe33eb1fc6200b4613f6c5dac3a9eff349e3a31d556b47a5e8a37354b73.jpg"],"titleId":"01003db01db1a000","dlc":[]}